# Package manager (locked)

## pnpm only

- **pnpm only** — never `npm install`, `npm ci`, `yarn`, or commit `package-lock.json` / `yarn.lock`.
- `packageManager` pins **pnpm@11.5.0** in `mobile/package.json` (and `worker/` where present).
- Lockfiles: **`pnpm-lock.yaml`** per live package (`mobile/`, `worker/`). The archived AI Studio root lockfile lives under `.archive/` only.
- Node **>=22** (`engine-strict=true` in each `.npmrc`).

## Commands by package

| Task | Mobile (`mobile/`) | Worker (`worker/`) |
|------|--------------------|--------------------|
| Install | `pnpm install` | `pnpm install` |
| Dev | `pnpm dev` (port **5173**, auto-reclaims) | `pnpm dev` (`wrangler`) |
| Build | `pnpm build` | — |
| Lint | `pnpm lint` | — |
| Tests | `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:pr`, `pnpm test:e2e` | package scripts if present |
| Deploy | GitHub Actions Pages workflow | `pnpm deploy` (ask first) |

Run commands from the package directory that owns the changed files.

## When editing

- After changing any `package.json`, run `pnpm install` in that directory and commit the updated lockfile.
- See **`repo-hygiene.mdc`** for stray lockfile cleanup.
